# PRIVATE (미방송분). Saeneoul house (room with a paper door, jangpan and maru floors, TV, phone),
# the house front with steps, and memorial-day props (stone, banner, offering table).
@palette ../../../art/palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/mbs_tiles_house.png
@preview ../previews/mbs_tiles_house_x4.png 4
@columns 8

